{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y 的音乐感受线索明显不如 X 细腻，削弱了具体音响变化、身体感受和情绪微妙转折的呈现。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y 把人物每一步的动机、矛盾和心理转变说得更清楚，普通观众不必自行拼接短词，就能理解他为什么这样想、前后为什么发生变化，十三段也更像一条连续的心理历程。X 的音乐感受描写更丰富，尤其是具体音响、身体反应和细微情绪变化，还有按音乐时刻出现的优势；但感受线索过于密集，部分短时段容易让观众顾着扫词而顾不上理解。整体而言，Y 更适合边听边看，X 更胜在音乐感受的细腻程度。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "42b2f027-ee16-49d7-90e7-b103cfe37d55", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T172352351248Z", "elapsed_seconds": 84.656, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T17:25:17.016649+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "9ab40b2d3c34e70eadebada6ff9156416d3c03e0b44a05bae15fe0d0d17f4dc9", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_att